# Keep the production deployment lean. Large binary assets should live on
# a CDN / video host (YouTube, Vimeo, Cloudflare Stream), not in the
# Vercel deploy. Vercel hard-caps individual files at 100 MB anyway.
#
# If you need to add a new media extension here, also add it to .gitignore
# so it doesn't accidentally get committed first.

# ── Raw video masters (promo sources, uncompressed recordings) ──────────
*.mov
*.MOV
*.mp4.bak
*.raw

# ── Large audio masters ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.wav
*.aiff

# ── Archives / export bundles ───────────────────────────────────────────
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.7z

# ── macOS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
